Demand Heterogeneity and Technology
\par
Evolution: Implications for Product and
\par
Process Innovation
\par
Ron Adner {$\bullet$} Daniel Levinthal
\par
INSEAD, Boulevard de Constance, 77305 Fontainebleau Cedex, France
