method. Bottom panel requires an additional step to express the equation that yields parameter estimates
\par
[ln(x)=(slope) z + (y-intercept)], where the slope estimates the standard deviation of ln(x) and the y-intercept
\par
(at z=0) estimates the arithmetic mean of ln(x).
