3.3. Characterization of Input Variables
\par
Because many of the parameters used to calcu-
\par
late VOI are uncertain, we apply probabilistic uncer-
\par
tainty analysis using Monte Carlo simulation tech-
\par
niques.(20) In earlier work, we assigned point estimates
\par
