\par
avoidance values. The basis for each of these esti-
\par
mates is described in the following section.
\par
Variables treated as uncertain in this analysis in-
\par
clude the sensitivity and specificity of the Glu-69 test,
\par
the cost per LPT and cost per Glu-69 test, the impact
\par
