\par
applicants would be replaced by Glu-69 individu-
\par
als. With voluntary screening participation might be
\par
somewhat lower, depending on the proportion of
\par
workers consenting to a susceptibility test and de-
\par
ciding to remove themselves from exposure when
\par
test results are positive. Because participation in the
