\par
MACHINE MAINTENANCE
\par
For a better understanding on how each tech-
\par
nique works, the initial part of this section brings
\par
a very simple example extracted from Smallwood
\par
and Sondik (1973), where the POMDP's solution
\par
of that article is compared with its Bayesian coun-
\par
terpart. Then, the comparison extends to a much
\par
higher level of complexity, where the DDN's im-
\par
