\par
In fact, even a person with limited or no back-
\par
ground in this domain may understand the basic
\par
issues governing the decision-making process in-
\par
side the system. As an example, looking at Figure
\par
10, one needs no domain background to realize
\par
that changing the radar mode (i.e. modifying the
\par
state of `radar action' decision node) will have an
\par
indirect impact on two objectives, `avoid fratri-
\par
