\textbf{Further reading}
\par
A wide-ranging introductory chapter by Berry and
\par
Stangl45 in their textbook61 covers a whole range
\par
of modelling issues, including elicitation, model
\par
choice, computation, prediction and decision-
\par
making. Non-technical tutorial articles include
\par
those by Lewis and Wears,295 Bland and Altman68
\par
and Lilford and Braunholtz.299 Other authors
\par
emphasise different merits of Bayesian approaches
\par
in health technology assessment: Eddy et al.148
\par
