\par
Prior distribution. Although the participating clini-
\par
cians were enthusiastic about CHART, there was
\par
considerable scepticism expressed by oncologists
\par
who declined to participate in the trial. Three
\par
forms of prior distribution are considered:
\par
1. A reference prior comprising a locally uniform
\par
distribution on the log(hazard ratio) scale,
\par
2. A clinical prior distribution was elicited from 11
\par
