\par
the pupil used the SLRC and the librarian and the second asked the pupil to describe how they
\par
felt the SLRC and librarian might help their learning. In reality the pupils found it difficult to
\par
distinguish between use and their learning and some interpretation was required during
\par
analysis. All pupils completed a SLRC Use Sheet, though the amount of detail varied between
