\par
extent to which the learning experience in the SLRC could be effective. These were
\par
considered to be important elements that needed to be taken into consideration when planning
\par
and evaluating the use of the SLRC for curricular or extra-curricular activities. A summary of
\par
these conditioning factors is reproduced in table 9.
