\par
{$\bullet$} \textbf{Serendipity \& exploration} (lifelong
\par
interest in books, information, knowledge)
\par
{$\bullet$} \textbf{Reinforcement}, revision \& development of
\par
skills, knowledge, ideas
\par
{$\bullet$} \textbf{Transference of skills \& knowledge}
\par
