\par
engine proceeds through the tree by generating inter-
\par
mediate conclusions, until the task priority associated
\par
with the root node has been drawn. A tool based on
\par
parser generator technology was described in [69] for
\par
creating a fuzzy decision tree from rules (or grammar
\par
clauses).
