\par
relaxation to decompose the multi-object optimization
\par
problem into many single object problems that are co-
\par
ordinated through introduced Lagrange multipliers. In
\par
this way, the relaxed sensor allocation problem is de-
\par
coupledhierarchically into twolevels. At thelowerlevel,
\par
the sensors for single objects are determined using the
\par
